  - `downloadFile`: looks up `FileReference` by id, loads the Mega file from `megaUrl`, streams it to the response with `Content-Disposition: inline` and UTF-8 encoded filename.
  - `deleteFile(fileId)`: deletes from Mega (first by `nodeId` via tree search, fallback by URL), then removes the `FileReference` doc. Swallows errors to still clean up the DB reference.
